d Microsoft. However, in this paper, we have demonstrated how to implement the virtual assistant empowered with disease prediction and movie recommendation based on the mood that an inquisitive starter can understand, by integrating the concepts of Automatic speech recognition, Artificial Intelligence, Natural Language Processing, and Interprocess communication. Having a robust assistant improves the time efficiency as well as reduces the efforts to perform simple repetitive tasks.","topics":[],"score":246004,"global_rank":69934,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":12593},{"name":"kamal-hamza/Carpool","owner":"kamal-hamza","html_url":"https://github.com/kamal-hamza/Carpool","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"Carpool Website with Django","topics":[],"score":246004,"global_rank":69935,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":12594},{"name":"jaybo/temca_neural_qc","owner":"jaybo","html_url":"https://github.com/jaybo/temca_neural_qc","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"Neural net to analyze TEMCA QC images","topics":[],"score":245999,"global_rank":69939,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":12595},{"name":"saebyn/trapeze-wsgi","owner":"saebyn","html_url":"https://github.com/saebyn/trapeze-wsgi","stars":7,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"A trapeze-compatible AMQP client that provides support for any web framework that uses the WSGI standard.","topics":[],"score":245995,"global_rank":69947,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":12596},{"name":"privatekenny/rotation","owner":"privatekenny","html_url":"https://github.com/privatekenny/rotation","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":245995,"global_rank":69953,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":12597},{"name":"rohit180497/Data-Encryption-Web-App","owner":"rohit180497","html_url":"https://github.com